   {
    "type": "verse",
    "number": 22,
    "content": [
     {
      "text": "The Lord possessed me -- That wisdom is more than the personification of an attribute of God, or of the will of God as best for man, but is a distinct adumbration of Christ, is sure to the devout mind. Proverbs 8:22-36; John 1:1-3; Colossians 1:17 can refer to nothing less than the Eternal Son of God."
     }
    ]
   }
